## 7. AI Tooling Sprawl

- 3 separate AI CLIs with different aliases/styles
- `AGENTS.md` duplicated in repo + `~/.config/opencode`
- No unified prompt library across tools
- `scripts/ai` only targets gemini

**Quick wins:**
- [ ] Single `ai` wrapper: `ai <prompt>` → route to active tool
- [ ] Unify AGENTS.md: symlink from repo to config
- [ ] Add model selector: `ai -m claude -p "prompt"`

**Deeper impact:**
- [ ] Central prompt library with YAML metadata
- [ ] Auto-context injection (git diff, recent files)

