## 8. macOS System Defaults

- Only 2 `defaults write` commands in setup.sh
- Could automate: dock, finder, keyboard, trackpad, screenshots, etc.

**Quick wins:**
- [ ] Dock: auto-hide, smaller icons, no recent apps
- [ ] Finder: show path bar, default to list view
- [ ] Screenshots: save to Downloads, disable shadow
- [ ] Keyboard: key repeat rate, disable press-and-hold for keys

**Deeper impact:**
- [ ] Full `macos-defaults.sh` script (inspired by mathiasbynens/dotfiles)
- [ ] Preference recorder (`pref-recorder.sh`) documented with examples

